and out of work.

00:08:09.054 --> 00:08:11.190
Trump was asked this afternoon
about Bannon's arrest

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.158
and all he could muster
was this...

00:08:13.158 --> 00:08:17.196
-I think it's a very sad thing
for Mr. Bannon.

00:08:17.196 --> 00:08:18.664
I think it's, uh...

00:08:18.664 --> 00:08:20.232
surprising.
-Oh, really?

00:08:20.232 --> 00:08:22.000
You're surprised?
Trump's probably just surprised

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.602
Bannon had the idea before him.

00:08:23.602 --> 00:08:25.504
[ As Trump ]
Jewelry and a boat?

00:08:25.504 --> 00:08:26.972
How come I don't have a boat?

00:08:26.972 --> 00:08:29.942
My hair would look great
flapping in the sea breeze!

00:08:29.942 --> 00:08:32.511
Trump then seemed to offer
some kind words for Bannon.

00:08:32.511 --> 00:08:34.013
-I do think it's a sad event.

00:08:34.013 --> 00:08:38.550
And again, Steve has had
a great career at Goldman Sachs.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.853
-Oh, Goldman Sachs.
Well, that's a surprise.

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:43.222
Those guys have never done
anything untoward.

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:46.058
That's like saying, "He was
in the mob?! I'm shocked!

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:47.226
He had such a great career
in sanitation.

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:49.361
Why would he just
throw that away?"

00:08:49.361 --> 00:08:51.296
Seriously, at this point,
Trump has enough criminals

00:08:51.296 --> 00:08:53.332
