livestreams it on Facebook.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.973
[ As Trump ]
Okay, that's the
top secret plan.

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:02.975
Lev, I can't help but notice
you're making

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:05.177
